.LONG TERM...
Issued at 1151 PM PDT Mon Sep 7 2026
(Wednesday night through next Monday)

Well above normal hot weather continues Thursday. Thereafter
northwest winds and a gradual weakening of the 500 mb ridge will
bring a cooling trend for late in the week and weekend. Daytime
highs will cool back to near normal Friday, then possibly a few
degrees below normal for the upcoming weekend. Late week weather
will be dry with the mid-latitude pattern settling back in.

